error_signature: "test hang|no output.*timeout|client.*recv.*block|EVBREAK|watchdog timeout fired|Server: .*Transfer-Encoding: chunked"
root_cause: "libuhttpd 类基于单线程事件循环（libev/libuv）的服务器库, test_package 若在主线程先发起客户端 HTTP 请求再 run loop, 客户端 recv 阻塞时会卡死事件循环无法 accept, 形成死锁; 且 chunked + Connection: close 响应在 recv 端可能不返回 EOF（连接保持打开）, 无 SO_RCVTIMEO 时 recv 无限期阻塞。"
rec_approach: "事件循环服务器库的 L1 消费者测试: ①服务器在主线程创建并 ev_run, 客户端请求放进独立 pthread（libev 允许跨线程 ev_break）; ②connect 前对候选端口循环重试; ③socket 设 SO_RCVTIMEO 5s, recv 遇 EAGAIN/EWOULDBLOCK 视为响应已收完; ④ev_run 前挂 20s watchdog 定时器, 未通过即 ev_break 并报 watchdog 超时, 防测试无限挂起。"
match_keywords: ["event loop", "test_package", "recv timeout", "SO_RCVTIMEO", "client thread", "watchdog", "chunked"]
error_excerpt: "client response: HTTP/1.1 200 OK\\nServer: Libuhttpd/3.14.2\\nTransfer-Encoding: chunked"
severity: P1
category: testing
trigger_tool: conan
applicable_library_types: [http-server, event-loop, libev, libuv, libevent]
counter_examples: ["纯客户端库（无需 accept）的测试不涉及此死锁", "上游已自带集成测试框架时可直接复用"]
verification: "libuhttpd 3.14.2 test_package: 独立线程客户端 + SO_RCVTIMEO + watchdog, conan create 全绿, 响应 200 校验通过"
limitations: "跨线程 ev_break 需 libev 支持（libev 文档允许）; fork 场景需重算 loop"
last_updated: 2026-09-27
